      "id": "44cb32576f0ee8b0d9f01aa5a4fa44ea0848c314",
      "message": "Retain denied host procfs observations without discarding sandbox results\n\nA denied optional host-side stat of /proc/1/root previously discarded an already executed namespace-boundary observation. Record host presence, absence or unknown with errno. Keep required host canaries, every actual inside boundary check and all ten mandatory release checks unchanged.\n\nValidation: nine namespace regressions passed; actual ordinary and denied-host-stat qualifications both passed all ten checks; a deliberately exposed synthetic canary failed the real boundary and release collector. Independent read-only review confirmed the repair does not relax sandbox policy.",
